From tru64-unix-managers  Thu Feb 28 18:53:14 2002
From: "Browett, Darren" <dbrowett () city ! coquitlam ! bc ! ca>
Date: Thu, 28 Feb 2002 18:53:14 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: UPDATE ; Runaway process - Solution found
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653731622498

I have since found an email from my system called EVMWATCH, ran that command
evmwatch -A which reported that the inetd process was running my process in
question.

stopped and started inetd and the messages stopped.

Sorry for sending out a panic message, when I should have done a little more
digging.

