However, even off CD it does not see the HSZ40 correctly.  I have 4 =
units configured on this array, D0, D1, D2 and D3 but only D0 is seen.  =
Each unit is about 20Gb is size but the system only sees one unit of =
80Gbs in size. =20

The adapter is a KZPSA with firmware A10 - correct according to the =
manual.  The host is an Alphastation 500/333 which is not formally =
supported with an HSZ40 but has always worked fine at all previous O/S =
versions.

Is there anybody out there who has successfully upgraded a system with =
an HSZ40 from 4.0x to 5.1 and is there anybody who has done it on an =
Alphastation 500 or similar?=20


Thanks,

Marco


