Warnings: Cluster 0  Local 1  Cluster/Local 0    Total: 1
WARNING: Ignoring error(s) - continue boot process.
Checking local filesystems
Mounting local filesystems
....and the file systems are OK.

I run currenlty 5.0a on this system with genvmunix but before upgrading
to 5.1a , it could be a good idea to resolve this problem...

Some idea ?

