Hello Admins,

We're runnning a 2 member, T64 version 4.0f (patch 3), ASE1.6 cluster.
In order to achieve some load balancing, the application requires that data 
be shared via NFS services between members acrossed a Fast Ethernet private 
network.

We are currently using NFS version3 over UDP. But I have read that we could 
gain some performance by using TCP.
