Hi,

I am currently upgrading an ES/40 cluster (4.0F/1.6) to 5.1A.  We purchased
a new machine to become the first cluster member.  We will then migrate one
of the cluster services to the new machine and so on...  In the end, we will
still have a two node cluster and a test machine.  I purchased base and
server licenses for the new machine figuring that I would input the
TruCluster license from the first box I am migrating.  In the end, I would
still have the same license situation as before.  Unfortunately, clu_create
