From tru64-unix-managers  Fri Feb 15 19:10:23 2002
From: "Statts, Pearce \(IndSys, GEFanuc, NA\)" <Pearce.Statts () gefanuc ! com>
Date: Fri, 15 Feb 2002 19:10:23 +0000
